==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|supercontinents}}

# A very large [[continent]] that [[split]] into smaller ones in the [[earth|Earth]]’s [[geologic]] past.
# Sometimes used to refer, due to their being composed of multiple continents, to one of the following modern landmasses: [[Afro-Eurasia]] and the [[Americas]]. (cf. [[subcontinent]])

